<p>You focus yourself on nature, allowing you to summon natural creatures much faster (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">69%, 56%, 49%, 43%, 39%</acronym> of a normal summon time) and with no chance to fail from high equilibrium for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>When activating this power, a random summoning talent will come off cooldown.</p><p>Each time you summon, the duration of the frantic summoning effect will reduce by 1.</p>